   <|"Data" -> ".md\nThis looks better, but now the system constantly \
oscillates and still has a systematic error propagating.\n\n### Integration \
(I)\nSo far we've played with the proportional component of the PID \
controller. The second most essential part is the *integral*, which \
accumulates *error* over time.\n\nHow do we do that? In the same way we did \
integration of our heat equation:", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "13b301c5-1f25-4a37-acaf-1251f7a34708", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
