    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "This looks better, but now the system constantly oscillates \
and still has a systematic error propagating.\n\n### Integration (I)\nSo far \
we've played with the proportional component of the PID controller. The \
second most essential part is the *integral*, which accumulates *error* over \
