   <|"Data" -> ".md\nWhere:\n- $u(t)$ is the **control signal** (e.g., \
voltage, force, or acceleration)\n- $e(t)$ is the **error** between the \
setpoint and the measured value\n- $K_p$, $K_i$, $K_d$ are the **tuning \
parameters** (gains) for each component\n\n\n| Component | Effect | Too Low | \
Too High |\n|-----------|--------|---------|----------|\n| **P** \
(Proportional) | Reduces rise time | Slow response | Oscillations, overshoot \
|\n| **I** (Integral) | Eliminates steady-state error | Residual error | \
Instability, windup |\n| **D** (Derivative) | Reduces overshoot & settling \
time | More overshoot | Noise sensitivity |\n", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "2cf0a1fb-b2b4-41be-a52d-7daebba1e73b", "Invisible" -> False, 
