   <|"Data" -> ".md\nNotice the oscillations! With only proportional control, \
the system overshoots and oscillates around the target. This is again where \
the **D** and **I** terms become essential. \n\n### Extending to PID\n\nHere \
we can no longer have an analytical solution, therefore we use `NDSolve`:", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
