   <|"Data" -> 
     "Here we can do it manually since it is quite simple system of \
equations:", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "0e48ecfa-03b6-4931-911d-7ca18526b5bd", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "testSystem[initialPos_, mass_] := Module[{stateV = {0., 0.}, \
stateX = {1.,1.} initialPos},\n  Function[{u, target, dt},\n    stateV[[2]] = \
stateV[[1]];\n    stateV[[1]] = If[Abs[stateX[[1]]] > 1, -stateV[[1]], \
stateV[[2]] + (*FB[*)((dt)(*,*)/(*,*)(mass))(*]FB*) u];\n    stateX[[2]] = \
stateX[[1]];\n    stateX[[1]] = Clip[stateX[[2]] + dt stateV[[1]], \
{-0.9,0.9}, {-0.88, 0.88}];\n\n    {stateX[[1]], target - stateX[[1]]}\n  \
]\n];", "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "68472443-ecbe-422d-b628-f829a9f9d427", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"InitGroup" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\nDon't forget to add boundary conditions, that our block \
will bounce off the wall and won't shoot into space.\nLet's test it under the \
constant force and then flip it to slow down back to the original state:", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "925b485a-d2e5-44fe-bd61-8ff776f53ee2", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "Don't forget to add boundary conditions, that our block will \
