rotation:\n\n$$\n\\\\hat{I} \\\\dot{\\\\vec{L}} = [\\\\vec{l} \\\\times \
\\\\vec{g}] m\n$$\n\nthen we restict ourself to the one coordinate, \
then:\n\n$$\n\\\\ddot{\\\\theta} = (g /l) \\\\sin(\\\\theta)\n$$", 
    "Display" -> "markdown", "Hash" -> 
