appear as some phantom moment of force in the moving \
frame:\n\n$$\n\\\\ddot{\\\\theta} = (g /l) \\\\sin(\\\\theta) + (1/l) \
\\\\cos(\\\\theta) a_{x}^\\\\prime\n$$\n\nTo complete the picture, let's add \
friction as well:\n\n$$\n\\\\ddot{\\\\theta} = (g /l) \\\\sin(\\\\theta) + \
(1/l) \\\\cos(\\\\theta) a_{x}^\\\\prime - d \\\\dot{\\\\theta}\n$$", 
