style=\"white-space: pre;\" direction=\"ltr\" \
dominant-baseline=\"text-before-edge\">stationary \
frame</text></g></svg></div>\n\n\nthe effect will appear as some phantom \
moment of force in the moving frame:\n\n$$\n\\\\ddot{\\\\theta} = (g /l) \
\\\\sin(\\\\theta) + (1/l) \\\\cos(\\\\theta) a_{x}^\\\\prime\n$$\n\nTo \
complete the picture, let's add friction as well:\n\n$$\n\\\\ddot{\\\\theta} \
= (g /l) \\\\sin(\\\\theta) + (1/l) \\\\cos(\\\\theta) a_{x}^\\\\prime - d \
\\\\dot{\\\\theta}\n$$", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "092dc1c5-b5bd-4a75-b2f2-f90a870ae14f", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\nLet's create a system of equations for that:", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "1dbca1de-6a29-4978-9566-76c98d459319", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "Let's create a system of equations for that:", 
    "Display" -> "markdown", "Hash" -> 
     "de45e8b9-434b-4349-997a-64a24d891af5", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "createPendulum[i\\[Theta]_, g_, l_, d_:0.1] := \
Module[{\\[Omega] = {0., 0.}, \\[Theta] = {1.,1.} i\\[Theta]},\n  \
Function[{ax, dt},\n    \\[Omega][[2]] = \\[Omega][[1]];\n    \\[Omega][[1]] \
= (1.0 - d) \\[Omega][[2]] + (*FB[*)((dt g)(*,*)/(*,*)(l))(*]FB*) \
Sin[\\[Theta][[1]]] + (*FB[*)((dt ax)(*,*)/(*,*)(l))(*]FB*) \
Cos[\\[Theta][[1]]];\n    \\[Theta][[2]] = \\[Theta][[1]];\n    \
\\[Theta][[1]] = \\[Theta][[2]] + dt \\[Omega][[1]];\n\n    \\[Theta][[1]]\n  \
]\n];", "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "a5f5fe40-1e04-4f9e-a2df-4fbf26972ef6", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"InitGroup" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\nLet's see how unstable it is:", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "44f8d704-f9c0-4b71-822c-cbb0d9d1d662", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "Let's see how unstable it is:", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "783f55e8-7e50-4769-94c0-81e7a6e6b58c", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "pen = createPendulum[0.01, 9.9, 1.0, 0.003];\nModule[{pos = \
{0,1.0}, t = 0.0}, Animate[\n  t = pen[0.0, 0.1];\n  pos = {Sin[t], \
Cos[t]};\n  Graphics[{Line[{{0,0}, pos}], Disk[pos, 0.05]}, \
PlotRange->{{-1,1}, {-1,1}}, AxesOrigin->{0.00001,0}, Axes->True, \
Ticks->None]\n, {dummy, 0, 0.5, 0.01}, Appearance->None]]", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "27da34c1-3e01-483a-86dc-e272f697c629", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> 
     ".md\nNow what if we apply a constant acceleration to one of the sides:"\
, "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "479a156c-2b6e-4651-bf53-576580bbd6d2", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
