    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "9c673000-6b4c-436e-b4a6-d378d6d85afc"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "Nope, you can't keep it stable with just your mouse.\n\n### \
Add PID\nLet's add a PID controller for the angular position, so it will \
drive our motors to keep the angle of the pendulum at 0. This can be \
illustrated as:", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "aae45093-da75-42a7-8a77-ff752f612dfd", "Invisible" -> False, 
